rees with Richardson on the question of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4011960925465697, "w": 0.596981916546123, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.42952648034209984, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "robots to explore outer space.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.42952648034209984, "w": 0.31051418776194484, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4578568304162375, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "advances made in machine intelligence so far.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4578568304162375, "w": 0.4714024455072181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4862119257238622, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "changes made to other planets for our own benefit.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4862119257238622, "w": 0.5248190742140206, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5145423135193924, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the harm already done by artificial intelligence.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5145423135193924, "w": 0.4838998785386872, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 37-40", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5833658240260827, "w": 0.17786226346596065, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6136244162425902, "w": 0.38207233791650635, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "37 What point does Richardson make about fear of machines?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6820400453320606, "w": 0.6494411159718192, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7103704708489833, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It has grown alongside the development of ever more advanced robots.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7103704708489833, "w": 0.7250306754661784, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7385524249649832, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It is the result of our inclination to attribute human characteristics to non-", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7385524249649832, "w": 0.7737600683349322, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "human entities.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7668828504819059, "w": 0.16054437623459267, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7952132005560435, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It has its origins in basic misunderstandings about how inanimate objects", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7952132005560435, "w": 0.7785107671193862, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "function.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8235435506301811, "w": 0.09478143627822935, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8518739761471038, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It demonstrates a key difference between human intelligence and machine", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8518739761471038, "w": 0.7785325024095927, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "intelligence.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y"